# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit): build context is the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/dev-dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
# secrets and local env files at any depth (examples are fine)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
.git
desktop
infra/var
backups
